  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/falden-fixtures/falden-fixture-pack/zipball/anchor/predicates-1",
  "body": "Anchor #1 of the Falden fixture pack. The tag's tree holds:\n\n- `anchor/predicates-1.manifest`: the sha256 of each file on the pack's verdict path, of the error taxonomy, of capture format 1 and of the release and recovery public keys, under a first line naming the build commit it was prepared from\n- `anchor/predicates-1.sig`: the release key's signature over the manifest\n- `anchor/predicates-1.tsr` (DigiCert) and `anchor/predicates-1.tsr2` (GlobalSign): RFC 3161 timestamp tokens over that signature\n- `anchor/allowed_signers` and `anchor/tsa-ca.pem`: the signing keys, and both authorities' certificate chains\n\nCheck the signature with stock OpenSSH:\n\n```\nssh-keygen -Y verify -f anchor/allowed_signers -I falden-fixture-release -n falden-fixture-anchor -s anchor/predicates-1.sig < anchor/predicates-1.manifest\n```\n\nCheck both timestamps with OpenSSL 3 (macOS's stock LibreSSL cannot verify GlobalSign's tokens):\n\n```\nopenssl ts -verify -in anchor/predicates-1.tsr -data anchor/predicates-1.sig -CAfile anchor/tsa-ca.pem\nopenssl ts -verify -in anchor/predicates-1.tsr2 -data anchor/predicates-1.sig -CAfile anchor/tsa-ca.pem\n```\n"
